Package: hoopvalue
Title: Measure NBA Player Value with Advanced Analytics
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("Ben", email = "18mathewbs@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Tools for measuring the value of NBA players with advanced
    statistics. Includes functions for shooting efficiency and for
    converting raw totals to per 100 possession rates so players on fast
    and slow teams can be compared fairly.
